  "_comment": [
    "The six TOCTTOU vulnerabilities of Table II.",
    "",
    "  poc   proof-of-concept client; built with -DEMULATE it talks to the emulator",
    "        over TCP (emulator/run.sh serves the TEEC_* protocol on port 1337) and",
    "        races a second thread against the TA on real shared memory, exactly as",
    "        the on-device PoC does against a phone.",
    "  ta    the TA the PoC opens a session to.",
    "",
    "The remaining fields pin the crash that Fetch-Anchored Fuzzing found for this",
    "vulnerability. They are only used by 'e2_vulns --replay', which needs the",
    "campaign data (not part of the git repository):",
    "  seed/reg_hash/snapshot/crash - the Exploration seed, the second fetch and",
    "  the crashing shared-memory value."
  ],
