      "poc_note": "The emulator path of this PoC used to modify cs->buffer[0x1000/4-2] of the *output* buffer (offset ~0xffc), while the double fetch is the TLV length at 0x1a-0x1b of the *input* buffer: the TA validates that length and re-reads it before use (the reads at PC 0xe368/0xe36c). The PoC now builds the header of the Exploration seed that reaches that parser and races the high byte of the length between 0x00 (validated 0x0004) and 0xc0 (0xc004), which makes the TA read past the end of the buffer. The device path of the PoC is unchanged."
